    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538350/extras/e77722c73107e4a51dafe41d99e2ff79.avif?t=1749239777\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A strategic yet fast-paced arcade-styled shooter with roguelike elements!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the story of 4 self-proclaimed heroes as they fight the injustice of the &quot;Earth Unit&quot; -  a collaborative government created by the people of Earth in an effort to keep their dying planet from becoming nothing but a memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538350/extras/9f6ac6630ea4e15d073f6c19ab8957af.poster.avif?t=1749239777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538350/extras/9f6ac6630ea4e15d073f6c19ab8957af.webm?t=1749239777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538350/extras/9f6ac6630ea4e15d073f6c19ab8957af.mp4?t=1749239777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Arcade-styled shooter action with a unique upgrade system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Real-time strategy overworld map that runs non-stop while you play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Randomized enemy placements, spawns, and upgrade chips!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Fully voiced dialogue with colorful characters! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Neato blips and beeps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Unique and engaging boss battles, each with vivid personalities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538350/extras/b08c9face5f7f0724be145f5790e2798.poster.avif?t=1749239777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538350/extras/b08c9face5f7f0724be145f5790e2798.webm?t=1749239777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538350/extras/b08c9face5f7f0724be145f5790e2798.mp4?t=1749239777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your support is what drives this game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dev would love to hear from you, and thank you for your support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Cover art by the amazing Hare Candy Art!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Trailer music by the talented Will Dodson!</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538350/extras/e77722c73107e4a51dafe41d99e2ff79.avif?t=1749239777\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A strategic yet fast-paced arcade-styled shooter with roguelike elements!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow the story of 4 self-proclaimed heroes as they fight the injustice of the &quot;Earth Unit&quot; -  a collaborative government created by the people of Earth in an effort to keep their dying planet from becoming nothing but a memory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538350/extras/9f6ac6630ea4e15d073f6c19ab8957af.poster.avif?t=1749239777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538350/extras/9f6ac6630ea4e15d073f6c19ab8957af.webm?t=1749239777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538350/extras/9f6ac6630ea4e15d073f6c19ab8957af.mp4?t=1749239777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Arcade-styled shooter action with a unique upgrade system!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Real-time strategy overworld map that runs non-stop while you play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Randomized enemy placements, spawns, and upgrade chips!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Fully voiced dialogue with colorful characters! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Neato blips and beeps!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Unique and engaging boss battles, each with vivid personalities!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538350/extras/b08c9face5f7f0724be145f5790e2798.poster.avif?t=1749239777\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538350/extras/b08c9face5f7f0724be145f5790e2798.webm?t=1749239777\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1538350/extras/b08c9face5f7f0724be145f5790e2798.mp4?t=1749239777\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Your support is what drives this game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The dev would love to hear from you, and thank you for your support!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Cover art by the amazing Hare Candy Art!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Trailer music by the talented Will Dodson!</i></p>",
